h","merged_at":"2025-04-03T21:56:21Z"},"body":"The EditorQuickOpenDialog does a check for missing resource paths, but if the path is UID, the check will print an error. This PR prevents that.\r\nI also added a code that will cleanup invalid paths and re-save history when necessary. While normally it does not matter, because history is re-saved when you open something, the dialog wouldn't modify history of a type you didn't open recently. If you had some outdated paths for rarely used types, they'd be loaded and skipped every time for no reason.\r\n\r\n* *Bugsquad edit, fixes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104961*","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104974/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104974/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}